# ROOFCAT: every third defeated foe drops catnip, until Harissa holds two.
# Losing a life loses them.
game roofcat
wait 5
cheat area 0 1
cheat clear_foes
cheat cam 0
cheat put 40 83
wait 20
cheat foe snail 90 80
press B
wait 30
cheat foe snail 90 80
press B
wait 30
cheat foe snail 90 80
press B
wait 12
hold RIGHT 40
expect power == 1
cheat kill
expect power == 0
